        "display": "def env(\n    *overlays: cabc.Mapping[str, str],\n    **kwvars: str,\n) -> EnvRegistration",
        "doc": {
          "summary": "Overlay environment variables on top of the live <code>os.environ</code>.",
          "body": [
            "Mirrors <code>dict</code> in how arguments are combined: positional mappings are merged left-to-right and any keyword arguments win over them. Values are not snapshot against <code>os.environ</code> — the live process environment is read at subprocess spawn time so that variables set after Cuprum is imported (for example by <code>monkeypatch.setenv</code>) remain visible."
          ],
          "sections": [
