        "display": "def merge_env_overlays(\n    parent: cabc.Mapping[str, str] | None,\n    child: cabc.Mapping[str, str] | None,\n) -> cabc.Mapping[str, str] | None",
        "doc": {
          "summary": "Layer <code>child</code> over <code>parent</code>; <code>None</code> means *inherit unchanged*.",
          "body": [
            "Both layers are kept overlay-only — they never include a snapshot of <code>os.environ</code>. The live process environment is read at spawn time so that callers can monkey-patch or otherwise mutate <code>os.environ</code> after Cuprum has been imported and still have those updates visible to subprocesses spawned inside the scope.",
