          "body": [
            "Supports <code>detach()</code> and context-manager use. The handle captures a <code>contextvars.Token</code> when it installs the extended hook tuple, and <code>detach</code> restores the exact tuple that was current when the handle was created — the same discipline <code>_TokenRegistration</code> applies to execution contexts. Detach in the <code>contextvars.Context</code> that created the registration; resetting a <code>ContextVar</code> with a token from another context raises <code>ValueError</code>.",
